350/extras/65553d6217e75771963ea4aa058aeb38.poster.avif?t=1726150954\" width=614 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/546350/extras/65553d6217e75771963ea4aa058aeb38.webm?t=1726150954\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/546350/extras/65553d6217e75771963ea4aa058aeb38.mp4?t=1726150954\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/546350/extras/e696800dfafa76e4de4e74fe0061d65c.avif?t=1726150954\" width=600 height=175 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VIRTUAL REALITY</h2><br>Craft Keep makes use of the Valve HTC Vive’s motion controller capabilities and uses room scale. We’ve been having great fun in the environment and really can’t wait to see players enjoying the game with this tech.",
